        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startmindmap\n&lt;style&gt;\nmindmapDiagram {\n  node {\n    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF\n    BorderColor #2D3748\n    FontName Arial\n    FontSize 12\n    Padding 8\n    RoundCorner 10\n  }\n  rootNode {\n    BackgroundColor #2F855A\n    FontColor #FFFFFF\n    FontSize 14\n    FontStyle bold\n    RoundCorner 12\n  }\n  :depth(1) {\n    BackgroundColor #E6FFFA\n    BorderColor #319795\n    FontColor #234E52\n    FontStyle bold\n  }\n  :depth(2) {\n    BackgroundColor #F7FAFC\n    BorderColor #CBD5E0\n    FontColor #2D3748\n  }\n}\n&lt;/style&gt;\n\n* **AgriSustain Platform**\\n(Core Features)\n\n** **[FE-01] Direct Agricultural Trade Management**\\n*(Resolves GAP-01)*\n*** Product Catalog &amp; Inventory Listing\n*** Multi-Segment Pricing Setup (B2C Retail &amp; B2B Bulk Discounts)\n*** Smart Product Search &amp; Multi-criteria Filtering\n*** Shopping Cart &amp; Dynamic Tier Price Calculation\n\n** **[FE-02] Harvest-Linked Ordering &amp; Order Fulfillment**\\n*(Resolves GAP-01)*\n*** Seasonal Pre-ordering &amp; Spot Ordering\n*** Order Processing (Confirm, Harvest Preparation, Packaging)\n*** Third-party Delivery Status Tracking\n*** Order Handover Confirmation &amp; History\n\n** **[FE-03] Seller Credential &amp; Farm Verification Workflow**\\n*(Resolves GAP-02)*\n*** Farmer &amp; Cooperative Profile Submission\n*** Agricultural Certificate Upload (VietGAP, GlobalGAP, OCOP)\n*** Admin Credential Audit &amp; Approval Portal\n*** Seller Trading Permission &amp; Policy Enforcement\n\n** **[FE-04] Digital Cultivation Logging &amp; Batch QR Traceability**\\n*(Resolves GAP-02)*\n*** Electronic Field Activity Logs (Sowing, Fertilizing, Spraying)\n*** Harvest Batch Creation &amp; Timestamping\n*** Dynamic Batch-Level QR Code Generation\n*** Public Web Traceability Inspection (QR Scanner)\n\n** **[FE-05] Regional Benchmark Price Dashboard**\\n*(Resolves GAP-03)*\n*** Daily Commodity Price Index Tracking\n*** Regional &amp; Provincial Price Comparison\n*** Historical Price Trend Charts &amp; Visualizations\n*** Suggested Pricing Indicator for Sellers\n\n** **[FE-06] Post-Harvest Dispute &amp; Quality Review Management**\\n*(Resolves GAP-02)*\n*** Verified Purchase Rating &amp; Review System\n*** Quality Non-compliance Complaint Ticket Submission\n*** Multi-party Dispute Mediation (Buyer, Seller, Admin)\n*** Refund, Compensation &amp; Dispute Resolution Workflow\n\n@endmindmap&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="dQhrEFzU9mHPbsD3ezhG-1">
